<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · 模型外面那一圈里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>这两件事的分界在哪</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", height: 230}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>提议</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12}}>模型 / Loop / Graph<br />给出下一步动作</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 14}}>可以给模型</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 2, background: "#1C1F23"}}></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 600, color: "#8A5A00"}}>检查</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12}}>权限 + 确定性门禁<br />独立判断</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#8A5A00", marginTop: 14}}>必须独立</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 2, background: "#1C1F23"}}></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>执行</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12}}>放行或拒绝<br />并留下记录</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 14}}>必须留在 harness</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 34}}>关键在「独立」两个字——检查方不能是提议方。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>18 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
